  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Hi I’ve noticed that a lot of people in the community are really interested in badges and enjoy collecting them. I was wondering why some badges can’t be made available for purchase. Maybe not all of them, especially exclusive or achievement based badges, but certain special badges could be sold for money.\n\nI think many people would be happy to support VRChat this way while also getting something they enjoy and value. It could be a fun option for the community and beneficial for VRChat as well. Just a suggestion  thanks for all your work!",
